# https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Security/vectorString node518
node518 [ shape=none, color=black label=< <table color='#666666' cellborder='0' cellspacing='0' border='1'><tr><td colspan='2' bgcolor='grey'><B>vectorString</B></td></tr><tr><td href='https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Security/vectorString' bgcolor='#eeeeee' colspan='2'><font point-size='10' color='#6666ff'>https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Security/vectorString</font></td></tr><tr><td align='left'>rdfs:comment</td><td align='left'>&quot;Specifies the CVSS vector string for a vulnerability.&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:definition</td><td align='left'>&quot;Specifies the CVSS vector string for a vulnerability.&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:note</td><td align='left'>&quot;Specifies any combination of the CVSS Base, Temporal, Threat, Environmental,
and/or Supplemental vector string values for a vulnerability.

Supports vectorStrings specified in all CVSS versions.

*Constraints*

String values for the vectorString range shall only include the abbreviated form
of metric names specified in CVSS specifications, e.g.
Common Vulnerability Scoring System Vector String &lt;https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document#Vector-String&gt;.&quot;@en</td></tr></table> > ] 
